        "TileImage": "$($repository 182a97da-9f67-427f-a6df-148a5ac84564).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Your targets are three officers of the Whittleton Creek Police Department: Rudolf Vento, Malcolm Hammer, and Sheriff Grant Masterson. Two years ago, the three were charged with the murder of Jackson Willis, a young man accused of being involved with sexual trafficking. Our client, one of the victims, discovered Willis WAS involved--but as only as an accomplice to Vento, Hammer, and Masterson. Traumatized and vengeful, our client has one simple request: make them pay.\r\r-Diana",
